[{"title":"水调歌头 括坡诗","author":"程节斋","text":"秋色正潇洒，佳气夜充闾。\n人传好语，君家门左正垂弧。\n毕万从来有后，释氏果然抱送，丹穴凤生雏。\n未作汤饼客，先写弄獐书。\n参军妇，贤相敌，古来无。\n钟奇毓秀，应是积善庆之馀。\n想见珠庭玉角，表表出群英物，我已预知渠。\n他日容相顾，啼看定何如。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1884,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 其二 题弩社头筹簇","author":"程节斋","text":"都尉部千弩，旧事汉材官。\n连拳一臂三石，夜半破阴山。\n曾使中有扪足，造次摧坚挫锐，分白辱宠涓。\n省括一机耳，人未识黄间。\n锦为标，虽有戏，技为难。\n疾飞两箭，兄弟齐夺姓名还。\n虎帐有筹第一，龙榜预占双捷，底事足荣观。\n未数蹶张辈，容易立朝端。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1885,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水调歌头 其一 题角人障","author":"程节斋","text":"养气兼养勇，岂不丈夫哉。\n何人刚欲斗力，谩向此间来。\n莫论施身文绣，看取兼人胆谅，胸次尽嵬嵬。\n独步登坛后，诸子尽舆台。\n笑渠侬，身贲育，伎婴孩。\n虚娇自恃，未识金德木鸡才。\n始也旁观退听，少则直前交臂，智与力俱摧。\n世有赏音者，为唱凯歌回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1886,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 其一 庆舍第生子","author":"程节斋","text":"自古人言，庆在子孙，端有由来。\n看长庚孕李，昴星佐汉，福从人召，瑞自天开。\n曾忆当年，乃翁熊梦，岂在区区春祀禖。\n祗凭个、仁心积累，厚德栽培。\n天工信巧安排。\n试说与君当一笑哉。\n记年时此际，嗷嗷万口，俾之粒食，活及婴孩。\n岁始星周，事还好在，故遣麒麟出此胎。\n何须问，是兴宗必矣，业广基恢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1887,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 其二 寿许宰二月初一","author":"程节斋","text":"三百篇诗，三十六篇，以祈寿言。\n惟上天所佑，锡之君子，中心岂弟，盖有仁存。\n允矣我公，韦平世胄，学问于兹有本原。\n临民处，看精神秋彻，气宇春温。\n由来淑景中分。\n第一日桑弧挂左门。\n是赋受不凡，仁而宜寿，笑渠谄子，徒费辞繁。\n命匪在天，算非由数，我只把公心地论。\n从今去，管亟登槐棘，福遍乾坤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1888,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"沁园春 贺新冠","author":"程节斋","text":"髧彼两髦，未几见兮，突而弁兮。\n记昔年犀玉，奇资秀质，今朝簪佩，丰颊修眉。\n满面春风，一团和气，发露胸中书与诗。\n人都羡，是君家驹子，天上麟儿。\n画堂人物熙熙。\n会簪履雍容举庆宜。\n看筮日礼宾，陈钟列俎，三加致祝，一献成仪。\n绿鬓貂蝉，朱颜豸角，早有君臣庆会期。\n荣冠带，看绶悬若若，印佩累累。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1889,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清平乐 寿伯母","author":"程节斋","text":"吾家三母。\n先后相为寿。\n管领诸郎尽明秀。\n都是婺女星宿。\n华筵今日居先。\n适逾甲子周天。\n敬以庄椿为祝，举觞我愿年年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1890,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"泗源","author":"程企","text":"泗源奇且怪，声势各喧豗。\n虎豹岩边去，蛟龙窟里来。\n稍流烟作阵，初激雪成堆。\n派必人疏导，源应鬼凿开。\n乍深涛不起，渐远浪相催。\n可把江心比，尝将海眼猜。\n始微才迸玉，终盛忽奔雷。\n涧为寒无卉，丘因涧有苔。\n已观离窦侧，俄见过城隈。\n石劲崖难漱，沙虚岸易颓。\n迩虽逾济漯，遐亦到蓬莱。\n洗钵僧常至，乘槎客未回。\n我从原际瞰，谁自谷中推。\n汹涌曾浮磬，潺湲好泛杯。\n狭宁容蚁穴，湍可暴鱼鳃。\n劈华非天意，排淮乃力哉。\n傍如巫女峡，上类楚王台。\n漏泽空神异，襄陵但水灾。\n林幽多鸟雀，地僻少尘埃。\n重爱兹佳趣，题诗愧不才。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1891,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"锁窗寒/琐寒窗","author":"程先","text":"雨洗红尘，云迷翠麓，小车难去。\n凄凉感慨，未有今年春暮。\n想曲江水边丽人，影沈香歇谁为主。\n但兔葵燕麦，风前摇荡，径花成土。\n空被多情苦。\n庆会难逢，少年几许。\n纷纷沸鼎，负了青阳百五。\n待何时、重享太平，典衣贳酒相尔汝。\n算兰亭、有此欢娱，又却悲今古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1892,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送徐殿院去国","author":"程壮","text":"殿中簪笔英风凛，直比朱弦清玉壶。\n谏奏百篇多蹇谔，精忠一力撼乾枢。\n笑哦老凤池边句，要取骊龙颔下珠。\n扣阙举幡心未副，芳名赢得满江湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1893,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答诚斋","author":"程如","text":"衡门时反关，一室甘却扫。\n文墨脱纷总，书林恣论讨。\n闯然未足意，清矣濯怀抱。\n挥洒乌丝新，浸淫黄卷好。\n后来应手摹，前辈休腹稿。\n君意不期知，予心以为宝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1894,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同章少连游西湖作浩歌行","author":"程安仁","text":"湖漘枕带三百寺，二时钟鼓惊鱼龙。\n祇应天下有此景，人间虽有难与同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1895,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖四景","author":"程安仁","text":"阳春三月天气新，湖中丽人花照春。\n满船罗绮载花酒，燕歌赵舞留行云。\n五月湖中采莲女，笑隔荷花共人语。\n靓妆玉面映波光，细袖轻裙受风举。\n芙蓉秋晓传清香，西施初洗匀新妆。\n中秋月魄两相照，玉壶皎洁无纤芒。\n严冬凛凛霜雪天，银山玉树相钩连。\n薄雪远草相掩映，似无似有虚无间。\n百年人事有尽处，四时景物无穷年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1896,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又会宿猿洞","author":"程师孟","text":"永感无心恋搢绅，十年不起卧龙身。\n一朝黄纸除书下，八郡衣冠尽望尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1897,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"与伯常会宿宿猿洞","author":"程师孟","text":"双塔和云宿翠屏，梦魂千里到禅扃。\n还教画手添新意，一簇林猿伴二星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1898,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书仲谟先人功德院","author":"程师孟","text":"高门馀庆本光山，不幸流离五代间。\n今日太平家可乐，郎君富贵锦衣还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1899,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"升山祠堂","author":"程师孟","text":"行处松萝深似幄，望中城郭细如棋。\n清泉可惜藏岩下，不作先生洗药池。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1900,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汤泉 其二","author":"程师孟","text":"山半炎泉涌不停，阴阳为炭自熏蒸。\n天公不许杨妃见，留待年年浴众僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1901,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"汤泉 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"曾看华清旧浴池，此泉何日落天涯。\n徘徊却想开元事，不见莲花见荔枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1902,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枫桥寺","author":"程师孟","text":"门对云山画不如，师今一念六年居。\n迩来寺好尤潇洒，张继留题内翰书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1903,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"南安军","author":"程师孟","text":"今日平安出岭时，瘴氛犹觉润征衣。\n一条路入江南去，万里人从海上归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1904,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝 其二","author":"程师孟","text":"重门画戟公堂峻，万瓦清烟使宅雄。\n草服劝耕菖叶绿，罗裙送酒荔枝红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1905,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔枝 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"水浮蓬岛通宾馆，日出扶桑照戟门。\n一等翠林无别水，四边惟有荔枝园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1906,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿猿洞和张徽韵","author":"程师孟","text":"更深应是枕双攲，思得皋夔事业齐。\n终为清时难退隐，出山甘被百禽啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1907,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宿猿洞饯仲谟","author":"程师孟","text":"洞口车轮欲去时，江山风物动光辉。\n不须猿鹤相惊怨，自是君王未放归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1908,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"植槦","author":"程师孟","text":"三楼相望枕城隅，临去重栽木万株。\n试问国人行往处，不知还忆使君无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1909,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游玉尺山寺","author":"程师孟","text":"永日清阴喜独来，野僧题石作吟台。\n无诗可比颜光禄，每忆登临却自回。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1910,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越山亭","author":"程师孟","text":"江山千古仙人地，城郭三春刺史天。\n文士莫如今日盛，方袍更比别州偏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1911,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"静游亭","author":"程师孟","text":"石磴高轩榜静游，度年红叶少惊秋。\n使君会得山僧意，不放笙歌到上头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1912,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉石","author":"程师孟","text":"万仞峰前一水傍，晨光翠色助清凉。\n谁知片石多情甚，曾送渊明入醉乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1913,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其七","author":"程师孟","text":"告老清朝分自安，从今荣悴不相关。\n有愁方见田家乐，无事才知钓叟閒。\n世故要看终始后，人生未免是非间。\n妇坟更在公茔侧，一舸夷犹遂往还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1914,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其四","author":"程师孟","text":"道出横塘跨石梁，塘南塘北稻花香。\n风吹舴艋轻如驶，日照浮图峻若翔。\n远岸渔樵三两两，近村鹅鸭一行行。\n回头却指城南路，云屋朱楼气郁苍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1915,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其八","author":"程师孟","text":"谁何不欲蚤忘机，今已高年古亦稀。\n翠柳阴中黄鸟过，青山影里白鸥飞。\n新春已到无高下，故里重过有是非。\n人意不如毛羽意，声声犹道不如归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1916,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其六","author":"程师孟","text":"舟行如叶泛长川，解水吴儿力可全。\n风急辄先千浪破，岸攲能把一䉡牵。\n湖沈日影山头画，云漏天光雨足悬。\n试向中流东北望，城南宝塔在门前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1917,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其三","author":"程师孟","text":"因省先茔到故都，不妨閒步问耕夫。\n水云苍莽遥连洞，田野低洼稍近湖。\n秋熟几家收橘柚，日生众口藉菰蒲。\n今朝偶得西华稻，僧饭年年出玉腴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1918,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"小航时过越溪头，当日吴宫事可求。\n西子冶容来作饵，伍员忠愤反为雠。\n虽无别馆虹蜺带，但有荒台麋鹿游。\n高望太湖千万顷，夕阳依旧水东流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1919,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其五","author":"程师孟","text":"寒林已见早梅芳，尽日临流野兴长。\n门外牛羊人自得，篱边鸡犬盗谁防。\n三江夜色沧浪白，千里秋香?稏黄。\n借问船中何所有，橙齑鲈鲙酒先尝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1920,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上巳游东禅","author":"程师孟","text":"出城林径起苍烟，白马遗踪俗尚传。\n第一僧居兰若处，几番身醉荔枝前。\n百年骚客来题寺，三月游人作乐天。\n更爱堂头迎太守，路旁先坠碧云编。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1921,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牛头寺","author":"程师孟","text":"前日闽都旧长官，穷冬从此据征鞍。\n牛头寺里千峰月，水口村边万石滩。\n竹叶尽来堂少暖，荔枝无处地多寒。\n明朝出境重回首，已约三山马上看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1922,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元厚之少保留题朱伯原秘校园亭 其三","author":"程师孟","text":"碧瓦春城十万家，可怜夫子独堪嗟。\n园林犹有前朝木，冠盖难寻故主花。\n亭瞰夕阳邻古刹，池通野水见晴沙。\n天然操尚无尘滓，合住蓬莱弄綵霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1923,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元厚之少保留题朱伯原秘校园亭 其二","author":"程师孟","text":"君家幽寂似山家，闻者其谁不见嗟。\n闭户几多闲日月，扫园有限旧烟花。\n书窗燕坐琴横石，吟径徐行杖卓沙。\n壁有谢公题好句，国人方此识馀霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1924,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵元厚之少保留题朱伯原秘校园亭 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"少年为学已名家，才折丹枝病可嗟。\n节带冰霜凌万竹，文含风露丽于花。\n也怜美玉犹存璞，人恨良金未出沙。\n赖有隐居如谷口，直将高意抗青霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1925,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"卧龙山","author":"程师孟","text":"闻说林泉便访寻，平田一径上孤岑。\n榕阴落处宜千客，荔子生时直万金。\n尽放迟回官舍近，不妨闲坐石门深。\n四边稻熟征租了，稍惬农家出郭心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1926,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝严院","author":"程师孟","text":"路口百馀松，南唐古梵宫。\n溪边石不断，钵里饭无穷。\n山态时时别，泉声处处同。\n元宗遗手墨，犹足耀门风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1927,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送虔州通判周茂叔对移永州","author":"程师孟","text":"移官远过耒阳西，好景重重合尽题。\n永水自然胜赣水，浯溪应不让濂溪。\n沙头候吏瞻旗脚，境上乡人待马蹄。\n会是忠贤流落处，至今兰芷尚萋萋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1928,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秦少游题郡中蓬莱阁次其韵","author":"程师孟","text":"半天钟鼓宴峥嵘，早晚阴晴景旋生。\n湖暖水香春载酒，月寒云白夜闻笙。\n金鳌破海头争出，玉鹭排烟阵自横。\n我是蓬莱东道主，倚栏长占日初明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1929,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晚登威武军鼓角楼","author":"程师孟","text":"百尺谯门戍万兵，黄昏初动画龙声。\n铜钲犹是闽王点，银秤才悬汉守更。\n四面僧誇金作界，半年人看玉为城。\n官程稍近千馀里，不到侬家向此行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1930,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寒食游九仙乌石二山","author":"程师孟","text":"城中无事喜寻山，千里提封并海宽。\n宾客相从筵既冷，士民同出食犹寒。\n芳园病叶堆何限，古院闲花落几般。\n谁道异乡多感慨，登临迟却十年官。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1931,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游枫桥偶成","author":"程师孟","text":"晚泊桥边寺，迎风坐一轩。\n好山平隔岸，流水漫过门。\n朱舫朝天路，青林近郭村。\n主人头似雪，怪我到多番。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1932,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"越二年正旦又会宿猿洞","author":"程师孟","text":"夜半春归晓始惊，郁然佳气入山亭。\n千门喜庆逢元日，一座光华见使星。\n难得同时传寿斝，合将新句勒诗屏。\n渔郎莫向游人道，洞口而今尽不扃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1933,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"入涌泉道中 其二","author":"程师孟","text":"穷冬未见六花飘，春意微微动柳梢。\n千丈龙形蟠暮岭，一条虹影落溪桥。\n阊门飞跨何清泚，茂苑繁雄未寂寥。\n切幸早归频出郭，西山隐客不须招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1934,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"科漏新成 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"台门新漏一声闻，从此朝昏百刻分。\n他日郡人思太守，也须谈及叶参军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1935,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午出游","author":"程师孟","text":"三山缥缈蔼蓬瀛，一望青天十里平。\n千骑临流搴翠幄，万人拥道出重城。\n参差螮蝀横波澜，飞跃鲸鲵斗楫轻。\n且醉樽前金潋滟，笙歌归道月华明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1936,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题共乐亭","author":"程师孟","text":"千门日照珍珠市，万瓦烟生碧玉城。\n山海是为中国藏，梯航尤见外夷情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1937,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"渔家傲","author":"程师孟","text":"折柳赠君君且住。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1938,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十三","author":"程师孟","text":"珊瑚花发客疑真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1939,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二十二","author":"程师孟","text":"收得一般潇洒物，龟形人送鹤书来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1940,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"程师孟","text":"苍烟巷陌青榕木。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1941,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"程师孟","text":"欧冶池塘晴潋滟，越王山寺晓玲珑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1942,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"程师孟","text":"七重楼向青霄动。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1943,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"程师孟","text":"阶前玉水供千指，钵里金沂饭百年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1944,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"程师孟","text":"高城落日龙吟角，远水浮烟蜃吐楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1945,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"程师孟","text":"城里人家半读书，学校未尝虚里巷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1946,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"程师孟","text":"芍药□难种。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1947,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十九","author":"程师孟","text":"山自昔来多积雪，寺从兴后有遗风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1948,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十七","author":"程师孟","text":"亭为新成号狮子，人曾旧隐作龙头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1949,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"程师孟","text":"海上风流荔枝国，人间潇洒菊花天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1950,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"程师孟","text":"为报寻芳沽酒客，年年到此且徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":1951,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]